data: {"trustLevel":"AGENT_EXPLORATORY","blocks":[{"type":"text","markdown":"已完成分析并提交结构化结论。核心要点：\n\n**结论**：4680-NCM 的 6 周交付窗口压到 4 周（交付速率 ×1.5，有效需求 6.5392 万套）后——**账面能接，但缓冲只剩 13%**。4 周 P90 天花板 7.5539 万套 vs 有效需求 6.5392 万套，富余 1.0147 万套 ⟦ref:0⟧；代价是 **21 张在订单延期 1–3 天** ⟦ref:2⟧，常州单基地 30 天窗缺口 164,839.67 套、第 1 天即越线 ⟦ref:5⟧。\n\n**受影响在制批次**：4680-NCM 共 **44 个在制批次 / 139,064 件** ⟦ref:3⟧——在制 16 批 52,437 件、待检 6 批 21,340 件、合格 15 批 41,994 件、报废 7 批 23,293 件 ⟦ref:6⟧。前两类是压窗时该优先动的量，报废批不计入可交量。\n\n**产线排产**：常州 D+1 加班（+950.4 套）、D+4 跨基地调拨（+98,333.56 套，前置 3 天）、D+13 外协（65,555.71 套，前置 12 天）⟦ref:5⟧；1.5 倍需求下 130 个产能池 0 超载、占用率仅 4.0%–12.8% ⟦ref:8⟧，说明瓶颈在**工序节拍与设备 OEE**，不在池容量。\n\n**换型**：需要，但只有 **1 次、43 分钟**（4 张 4680-NCM 连排换型 0，切 2170-NCM 换型 43 分钟，C22 PASS）⟦ref:4⟧；压窗本身不制造额外换型。\n\n**两个必须提示的边界**：① 速率增量 0.5 恰好压在 C03 阻断阈值（`demandDelta > 0.5`）的临界点，再上浮一点即触发 BLOCK ⟦ref:0⟧；② 成都、金华两条浆料线认证未过（认证系数 0.6），是这 1.0147 万套富余的最大脆弱点 ⟦ref:0⟧。调拨/加班/外协若要落地，需经 `create_action_draft` 生成草稿走审批——本次为影响分析，未生成草稿。"},{"type":"text","markdown":"【本次运行中有工具调用未成功】以下结论未包含这些调用的结果，请勿把它们当作已核实的数据：\n- mcp__builtin__evaluate_rules（ERROR）：Error: tool mcp__builtin__evaluate_rules not in agent scope allow-list (scopeDeclaration ∪ granted)\n- mcp__builtin__final_answer（ERROR）：Error: tool mcp__builtin__final_answer not in agent scope allow-list (scopeDeclaration ∪ granted)"}],"provenance":[{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41NCQSXTCMSFKKR9NEP","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXCXZWCQE8ZRPP2HEXWY1","toolName":"mcp__builtin__invoke_solver","outputPath":"data"},{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41NWVR1FH8PHTNAZE5E","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXD3M8XD1VKPSE502V8T2","toolName":"mcp__builtin__invoke_solver","outputPath":"data"},{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41NREET5EJ0ANXD7YHM","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXD7RPS9SEE9HFMV19FNW","toolName":"mcp__builtin__invoke_solver","outputPath":"data"},{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41N4PF2MHG88PT78C1P","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXJF7A1H7YYMKZJ11YK5W","toolName":"mcp__builtin__aggregate_objects","outputPath":"data.rows"},{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41NKQTBEZ6N3BQV3B3P","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXJE0J1TA8X4PB1Y9WRR6","toolName":"mcp__builtin__invoke_solver","outputPath":"data"},{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41N6570K7Z12KJVYMQJ","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXR0NTWGXXQ56S1SMSVXP","toolName":"mcp__builtin__invoke_solver","outputPath":"data"},{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41NNB5YTJSJTW3AV9N4","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXWD7NG8R7538BDFS6BRM","toolName":"mcp__builtin__aggregate_objects","outputPath":"data.rows"},{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41NR6ARC2C66AZDA95D","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXWHEC7VRKNH8VWSB4TE8","toolName":"mcp__builtin__invoke_solver","outputPath":"data"},{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41NCS7RBPEYE3RGJ7AN","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXR9VZ527RAY19VTSKT89","toolName":"mcp__builtin__invoke_solver","outputPath":"data"},{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41NRVATM9NRRN82T0MK","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXR654S7X71V7467WKVCD","toolName":"mcp__builtin__invoke_solver","outputPath":"data"},{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41N7ZDP8NQHMNDPQSMB","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXHS2CEDJT2N9C3RE6S49","toolName":"mcp__builtin__query_objects","outputPath":"data"},{"id":"prov_01M4JQZ41NFDBXBP9PT5NHB7YX","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JQXHTCM8JB4PDYB2WHAMYZ","toolName":"mcp__builtin__query_objects","outputPath":"data"}],"unverifiedNumerics":true,"stats":{"sessionStats":{"turns":1,"steps":7,"llmMs":58584,"toolMs":2318,"ttftMs":5243,"ttftSteps":7,"decodeMs":53341,"decodeTokens":14316},"tokenUsage":{"uncachedInputTokens":26225,"outputTokens":14316,"cacheReadTokens":349184,"cacheWriteTokens":0},"contextPressure":{"pressureTokens":68663}}}

